{
  "id": "liquid-vocabulary.v1",
  "schema": 1,
  "contractNode": "LIQ0",
  "family": "liquid",
  "describes": "docs(arch): record the parser decision, ownership, reuse and lineage (#812), 2026-10-09",
  "rules": [
    "Every table names one exact source (package, registry, pin and path inside the published artifact). A path is relative to the artifact root: the gem root for rubygems, the tarball's package/ directory for npm. A name is in a dialect only through a table of that dialect; a name shared by two dialects appears in a table of each, with each dialect's own source.",
    "Tables are written from the official published artifacts of the reference pins in liquid-version-lock.json, never inferred from spellings or from another dialect. LIQ4 reads this file as the only object and filter source.",
    "Block delimiters (else, elsif, when and end<tag>) are grammar, not tags, and are listed once per dialect under blockDelimiters.",
    "A tag or filter outside its dialect's tables is unknown: an opaque node for a tag (LIQ1-AC3), Unavailable with a reason for a filter (LIQ4-AC2)."
  ],
